; PT15 (#951): AutoCAD 2021 lock-position groups from the immutable CC0 drawing
; autocad-attributi.dxf (Matleyx78/dxf-test-file, commit 0108805582166d376b12d8f3a053cbce4df798c1).
; The second group 280 is 1 for SIGLA; the first group 280 remains the version (0).
; ATTRIB SIGLA is checked directly; the identical round-trip preserves ATTDEF SIGLA.
D = DXF source=autocad-attributi
? count D -> ATTRIB 15; INSERT 3
; cambia con #951
? entity D A3 -> ATTRIB owner=161 position=27.5498725576756,-36.70130683911319 alignment-point=30,-35 height=2.49999999999999 rotation=10 width-factor=1 oblique=0 style="Standard" mirror-x=no mirror-y=no horizontal=center vertical=middle value="S10" tag="SIGLA" lock-position=yes
? roundtrip D -> identical
